@startuml
title Chunk generation (steady state, region already solved)

start
:Chunk requested at column x,z;
:Find macro-cell for x,z;
:Find solve-region containing that cell;

if (region already in cache?) then (no)
  :Solve region\n(see region-solve-activity.puml);
else (yes)
endif

:Read biome-id for macro-cell\n(+ neighbor cells for border blend);
:Density Router picks shape params\nfrom biome-id (blended near borders);
:Generate column density / terrain;
:Feature Gate applies per-biome\nfeature toggles (rivers, lakes, ...);
stop
@enduml